# "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, put a page counter on this artifact." Bot1 casts Diary of Dreams and
# then the Ornithopter (an artifact creature spell: no counter, positive control for the casts below); Bot2 casts a Lightning Bolt
# on turn 2 (an instant, but an opponent's spell: no counter, CR 603.2 "you"); on turn 3 Bot1's own Lightning Bolt (instant)
# and Duress (sorcery) put one counter each: two page counters in the end, never more.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Diary of Dreams
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Duress
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Plains x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Diary of Dreams.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
? Bot1.Battlefield.Diary of Dreams.Counters.Page = (absent)
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Diary of Dreams.Counters.Page = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Diary of Dreams.Counters.Page = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Diary of Dreams.Counters.Page = 2
Bot1.Life = 17
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Graveyard = Duress; Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
